BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:kimolos-chorio-feast-of-osia-methodia-chorio-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20271004
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20271006
SUMMARY:Feast of Osia Methodia\, Chorio
LOCATION:Chorio\, Kimolos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Kimolos's own saint\, Osia Methodia (1861–1908)\, is honoured at the Panagia Odigitria church where her relics rest: vespers on 4 October\, liturgy and a procession of the relics on the 5th\, then a glenti with live folk music laid on by the residents and the municipality. It is an off-season feast\, so ferries are thin — come from Milos by the Pollonia boat and stay the night.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kimolos/#chorio-feast-of-osia-methodia-chorio
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kimolos/#chorio-feast-of-osia-methodia-chorio
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:kos-asfendiou-panigiri-of-agios-dimitrios-asfendiou-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20271025
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20271027
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agios Dimitrios\, Asfendiou
LOCATION:Asfendiou\, Kos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The autumn feast of the mountain villages of Asfendiou (Zia\, Lagoudi\, Evangelistria) is Agios Dimitrios on 25-26 October\, with a vespers and a glendi with local food. A good excuse for the Zia sunset without the coach parties.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kos/#asfendiou-panigiri-of-agios-dimitrios-asfendiou
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kos/#asfendiou-panigiri-of-agios-dimitrios-asfendiou
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ikaria-agios-dimitrios-autumn-panigiri-of-agios-dimitrios-agios-dim-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20271026
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20271027
SUMMARY:Autumn panigiri of Agios Dimitrios\, Agios Dimitrios (Raches)
LOCATION:Agios Dimitrios\, Ikaria\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The last panigiri of the year on the west side: on 26 October the village of Agios Dimitrios in Raches\, via its cultural association 'I Litani'\, serves roast kid\, mezedes and Ikarian wine with the Stroupa/Zevkalides orchestra. Autumn light\, no tourists\, jackets needed. The village also has summer feasts (a July glendi with the Zevkalides and Agios Fanourios on 27 August).\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ikaria/#agios-dimitrios-autumn-panigiri-of-agios-dimitrios-agios-dim
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ikaria/#agios-dimitrios-autumn-panigiri-of-agios-dimitrios-agios-dim
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
